    "title": "Markdown 与扩展语法",
    "summary": "GFM、YAML、Astryx Banner/Chat/Tabs/LinkCard、可见 CriticMarkup、学习闪卡/Cloze/快捷键、脚注、稳定锚点、Mermaid 与链接图标",
